            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A series of amiloride derivatives modified at the 5-position of the pyrazine ring were evaluated as inhibitors of acid-sensing ion channel-3 (ASIC3), a novel target for the treatment of chronic pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
